message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vitaldb-resolution: VitalDB recorded values and times as distributions of the true value"
authors:
  - family-names: Goodwin
    given-names: "Andrew J."
    affiliation: "School of Biomedical Engineering, The University of Sydney"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2776-7039"
abstract: "Every recorded VitalDB time and value as a probability distribution of the true value: native resolution, or a mixture of rounding modes deconvolved from heaped data. Models are versioned JSON files evaluated by one generic engine."
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/metrology-atlas/vitaldb-resolution"
